=== rival_line_post ===
{ c2day9 == "watch" && not watched9: -> c2day9_watch }
{ cairn10 && not lying_up10: -> c2day10_lie_up }
From the post you can see a long way down the line in both directions. Nothing moves.
-> END

=== rival_line_our_sign ===
Your clan's sign, facing out. It means: this is ours.
-> END

=== rival_line_gap ===
The ground dips under the fence here. Low enough to get under, if you keep your head down.
Someone has, recently.
-> END

=== rival_line_their_sign ===
Their sign, facing back at yours. It means the same thing.
-> END

=== rival_line_cairn ===
Plates stacked into a pile on their side. A marker, or a message.
-> END
